    "name": "Decimate 1D Array",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Split [1,2,3,4,5,6] into two alternating streams. Read [1,3,5] and [2,4,6] at their terminals.\n\nSplit [1,2,3,4,5,6] into two alternating streams. Read [1,3,5] and [2,4,6] at their terminals.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: studio.native.composed@1.\nExpected:\nfirst (array<i32>) = [1,3,5]\nsecond (array<i32>) = [2,4,6]\n",
